a><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiTab-root MuiTab-textColorInherit mui-1clht11" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="false" href="/trending" idx="2" id="tab-2" aria-controls="tab-2">Trending</a><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiTab-root MuiTab-textColorInherit mui-1clht11" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="false" href="/groups" idx="5" id="tab-5" aria-controls="tab-5">Discover</a></div></div></div><main class="marginAboveMainContentProvider mui-76zzj0"><div class="mobileMarginProvider"><h1>Welcome to the community</h1><p class="bodyText spacer">To get started, here are some posts from our most popular groups: <a href="/groups/a225/pregnancy">pregnancy</a>, <a href="/groups/a235/baby">babies</a>, and <a href="/groups/a215/actively_trying">getting pregnant</a>. You can also <a href="/groups">discover more</a> topics in all of our groups.</p><section class="mui-i7uzrb"><h2>Posts about pregnancy</h2><ul class="postList unstyledLinks communityText mui-1sh4vf"><li id="post-34142441" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/groups/a225/pregnancy">Pregnancy</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/post/a34142441/medical-leave-in-pregnancy">Medical leave in pregnancy</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">z</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By ZeeSh12 </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Has anyone gotten any medical leave due to work being so stressful. My boss is micromanaging everything to the point she believes my team is not working hard and also lying to her. She is in another office so she doesn't trust my word. Its becoming too stressful as I am unable to sleep, I keep think</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">a day ago by Mama1to3</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>1</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-34142409" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/groups/a225/pregnancy">Pregnancy</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/post/a34142409/subchronic-hematoma">Subchronic hematoma </a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-nkvp61" size="20" aria-hidden="true">t</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Tebitedwa </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">I'm 7 weeks pregnant with hematoma it started at 4 weeks, any one who h had positive results and overcome it. Tell me about the discarge </div><div class="timestamp finePrint">20-10-26 by SamLou1586</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>2</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-34142326" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/groups/a225/pregnancy">Pregnancy</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/post/a34142326/tmi-possible-mucus-plug">TMI (POSSIBLE MUCUS PLUG )‼️</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">j</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Justamommy27 </span></div></div><div><div class="mui-1opmajx"><div class="mui-e0on0p"><picture class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-1dhrdme"><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://static.babycenter.com/user/Gvdi94pGcR43e4Vd/gb-b16d2194-524a-4c5e-9add-5560f261dece_h230.webp 600w,https://static.babycenter.com/user/Gvdi94pGcR43e4Vd/gb-b16d2194-524a-4c5e-9add-5560f261dece_h350.webp 2000w"/><img alt="Comment Image" src="https://static.babycenter.com/user/Gvdi94pGcR43e4Vd/gb-b16d2194-524a-4c5e-9add-5560f261dece" srcSet="
