I’m 10dpo. 2 children trying for our 3rd. I have a history of miscarriages and I’m also 40 so times cracking on 😂 
Never experienced implantation bleeding with either pregnancies before. It started last night. Noticed when I wiped. It’s slowed down a lot since last night</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">18-10-26 by Vixminator</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>1</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_Filled_rejuv.svg" alt="replied with hug" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">1</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-34142356" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/groups/a215/actively_trying">Actively trying</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/post/a34142356/weird-dreams">Weird dreams</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-nkvp61" size="20" aria-hidden="true">t</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By tashap84 </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">I had a dream last night. It felt so real and I was crushed when I woke up to reality and realised it wasn't.
I had just had twin boys, Saxton and paisley. (I've never heard to name Saxton).
