Thank you! </div><div class="timestamp finePrint">19-10-26 by Routa01</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>10</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_gray_rejuv.svg" alt="no reactions" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">0</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-34142293" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/groups/a215/actively_trying">Actively trying</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/post/a34142293/when-to-test">When to test</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">b</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Bethy1312 </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">Hey ladies im back again🫣 I haven’t tracked ovulation as my cycles are bizarre anything from 27-44 days. I went on holiday 7th October and returned yesterday. The night before I travelled I had pulling cramps which I’m assuming could have been ovulation along with increase of CM. Then on the 11th 5</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">21-10-26 by Bethy1312</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17