nk it's reasonable to sit in a coffee shop?  Is it rude to overstay your welcome in such an establishment if you've bought something? \n\nDoes buying more entitle you to stay longer even after you've finished eating/drinking?\n\nDoes your time allowance depend on how ","url":"/post/a34142464/how-long-does-a-coffee-buy-you-a-seat-for","isSensitive":null,"createDate":"2026-10-21T22:41:02.000Z","updateDate":"2026-10-21T22:41:02.000Z","lastActivityDate":"2026-10-22T17:29:06.000Z","cmntCount":8,"images":[],"giphies":[],"user":{"globalUserId":"uCouZ8OXdskI2Ddu","screenName":"SmokeMeAKipper","imageUrl":"https://imageserve.babycenter.com/16/000/433/fZqVMcaKTyvFZ5QvH2prk90kqiEbNUkY_sq.jpg","__typename":"UserPublic"},"updateUser":{"globalUserId":"uCouZ8OXdskI2Ddu","screenName":"SmokeMeAKipper","imageUrl":"https://imageserve.babycenter.com/16/000/433/fZqVMcaKTyvFZ5QvH2prk90kqiEbNUkY_sq.jpg","__typename":"UserPublic"},"group":{"globalUserId":"jTt692KNtkDfdKyN","id":"712475","title":"What's Your Opinion On ...?","url":"/groups/a712475/whats_your_opinion_on","__typename":"Group"},"lastActivityUser":{"screenName":"SmokeMeAKipper","__typename":"UserPublic"},"reactions":{"types":[],"count":0,"__typename":"ReactionSummary"},"poll":null,"__typename":"Post"},{"id":"34142443","globalUserId":"DvWzzrGUGE0A4yAn","title":"Saving Vs spending Child Benefit ","bodySnippet":"Wasn't sure what to call this, I saw an interesting post and comment section elsewhere so thought I'd see what you all thought\n\nWith regards to Child Benefit - the £108 a month one that is universal if you earn below £100k / £60k for the sliding scale NOT related to universal credit\n\nIf you receive ","url":"/post/a34142443/saving-vs-spending-child-benefit","isSensitive":null,"createDate":"2026-10-21T10:37:05.000Z","updateDate":"2026-10-21T10:37:05.000Z","lastActivityDate":"2026-10-22T13:01:12.000Z","cmntCount":15,"images":[],"giphies":[],"user":{"globalUserId":"DvWzzrGUGE0A4yAn","screenName":"Sophie19842","imageUrl":"ht