lease ","bodySnippet":"I’m currently 12 weeks pregnant, yet to have my scan which is due shortly, I had a reassurance scan at 8 weeks and all was well thankfully, however I have been recommended to start aspirin, but nobody seems to be able to reassure me or give me the information I’ve been looking for aside from studies","url":"/post/a34142294/aspirin-in-pregnancy-helppppp-please","isSensitive":null,"createDate":"2026-10-15T09:33:49.000Z","updateDate":"2026-10-15T09:33:49.000Z","lastActivityDate":"2026-10-23T13:07:19.000Z","cmntCount":4,"images":[],"giphies":[],"user":{"globalUserId":"tncrfmWcMbg87KWr","screenName":"ANXIOUSANNIE","imageUrl":null,"__typename":"UserPublic"},"updateUser":{"globalUserId":"tncrfmWcMbg87KWr","screenName":"ANXIOUSANNIE","imageUrl":null,"__typename":"UserPublic"},"group":{"globalUserId":"whMf8yQx0LEdBV72","id":"225","title":"Pregnancy","url":"/groups/a225/pregnancy","__typename":"Group"},"lastActivityUser":{"screenName":"Mama1to3","__typename":"UserPublic"},"reactions":{"types":[],"count":0,"__typename":"ReactionSummary"},"poll":null,"__typename":"Post"},{"id":"34142218","globalUserId":"b1RxhdPUlMsS5ly6","title":"Induction and epidural","bodySnippet":"Hi Ladies,\nMy waters broke at 34 +4, so I'm being induced at 37 weeks. The plan initially was cesarean, but due to baby safety, it's been agreed vaginal is safer. \nI've asked for an epidural before the drip as I've heard horror stories about contractions when using the drip. \nHowever im terrified th","url":"/post/a34142218/induction-and-epidural","isSensitive":null,"createDate":"2026-10-12T11:29:55.000Z","updateDate":"2026-10-12T11:29:55.000Z","lastActivityDate":"2026-10-13T06:04:39.000Z","cmntCount":1,"images":[],"giphies":[],"user":{"globalUserId":"b1RxhdPUlMsS5ly6","screenName":"Cmj2908","imageUrl":null,"__typename":"UserPublic"},"updateUser":{"globalUserId":"b1RxhdPUlMsS5ly6","screenName":"Cmj2908","imageUrl":null,"__typename":"UserPublic"},"group":{"globalUserId":"whMf8yQx0LEdBV72","